The split lists (train_clean.txt, val_clean.txt, train_crc.txt, val_crc.txt,
train_group2.txt, val_group2.txt, train_list.txt, val_list.txt), the MD5 inventory
(md5_lc25000.csv), the figure data (figures/fig1_delta_data.csv) and the result
files (KAN/*.json, KAN/*_preds.npz) are released under CC BY 4.0.

The image datasets LC25000 and CRC-VAL-HE-7K are third-party data, are not
redistributed here, and remain under their original licences.
